# Never upload local environment files to a deployment.
#
# The Vercel CLI uploads the working directory, and a stray .env would be read
# by dotenv during the build — pointing Prisma Migrate at localhost instead of
# the platform-injected database. Environment comes from Vercel, never a file.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
.next
.git
.vercel
